  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"K\u0131l\u0131\xE7 Kral\u0131\" kart\u0131n\u0131
    \"ters\" se\xE7tin.\n\nGe\xE7mi\u015Fte ya\u015Fad\u0131\u011F\u0131n birtak\u0131m
    tersliklerden bahseden bu kart\u0131 iyi ki \"gelecek\" i\xE7in \xE7ekmedin {{isim}}.
    Senin i\xE7in olduk\xE7a talihsiz ge\xE7en zamanlar ya\u015Fam\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n.
    Baz\u0131 \u015Feyler daha da iyiye gitsin diye u\u011Fra\u015F\u0131p \xE7abalarken,
    k\xF6t\xFC sonu\xE7lar alm\u0131\u015F, kendini s\u0131f\u0131r noktas\u0131nda
    ve \"t\xFCkenmi\u015F\" hissetmi\u015Fsin. Yapt\u0131\u011F\u0131n maddi ve manevi
    yat\u0131r\u0131mlar\u0131n geri d\xF6n\xFC\u015Flerini alamam\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n.
    \u0130nsanlar seni hayal k\u0131r\u0131kl\u0131\u011F\u0131na u\u011Fratm\u0131\u015F;
    emek, zaman hatta para kaybetmi\u015Fsin. Sevmedi\u011Fin ki\u015Filer ya da
    rakiplerin, senin bu \u015Fanss\u0131z d\xF6neminde yol alm\u0131\u015F, yan\u0131ndan
    ge\xE7ip gitmi\u015Fler. Senin istedi\u011Fin nokta ve pozisyonlardan baz\u0131lar\u0131
    onlar taraf\u0131ndan kap\u0131lm\u0131\u015F. Neyse ki bu bahts\u0131z d\xF6nemin
    geride kalm\u0131\u015F."
